
### 1. Check Current Inventory
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1


### 2. Check Current Batches
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/inventory/1


### 3. Record Damaged Stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 3,
  "wasteReason": "DAMAGED",
  "quantity": 5,
  "unitCost": 0.80,
  "notes": "Apples damaged during shelf stocking"
}


### 4. Record Spoiled Stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 4,
  "wasteReason": "SPOILAGE",
  "quantity": 8,
  "unitCost": 0.80,
  "notes": "Rotten apples identified during inspection"
}


### 5. Record Quality Issues
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 4,
  "wasteReason": "QUALITY_ISSUE",
  "quantity": 3,
  "unitCost": 0.80,
  "notes": "Products failed quality inspection"
}


### 6. Record Other Waste
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 3,
  "wasteReason": "OTHER",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitCost": 0.80,
  "notes": "Products discarded after falling on the floor"
}


### 7. Get Waste Record
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/1


### 8. Get Store Waste History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/store/1


### 9. Get Inventory Waste History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/inventory/1


### 10. Get Batch Waste History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/batch/3


### 11. Get Store Waste Summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/store/1/summary


### 12. Verify Inventory Quantity
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1


### 13. Verify Batch Quantities
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/inventory/1


### 14. Verify Stock Movement History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements/inventory/1


### 15. Verify Batch Movement History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/3/movements


### ============================================
### NEGATIVE TEST CASES
### ============================================

### 16. Unknown Batch - Expect 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 999999,
  "wasteReason": "DAMAGED",
  "quantity": 5,
  "unitCost": 0.80
}


### 17. Insufficient Batch Quantity - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 3,
  "wasteReason": "DAMAGED",
  "quantity": 999999,
  "unitCost": 0.80
}


### 18. Zero Quantity - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 3,
  "wasteReason": "DAMAGED",
  "quantity": 0,
  "unitCost": 0.80
}


### 19. Negative Unit Cost - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 3,
  "wasteReason": "DAMAGED",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitCost": -0.80
}


### 20. OTHER Without Notes - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 3,
  "wasteReason": "OTHER",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitCost": 0.80
}


### 21. Non-expired Batch - Expect 400
### Valid while Batch 4 has not expired
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 4,
  "wasteReason": "EXPIRED",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitCost": 0.80
}


### 22. Unknown Waste Reason - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": 3,
  "wasteReason": "INVALID_REASON",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitCost": 0.80
}


### 23. Unknown Waste Record - Expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/999999


### 24. Unknown Store - Expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/store/999999


### 25. Unknown Inventory - Expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/inventory/999999


### 26. Unknown Batch History - Expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/batch/999999


### 27. Unknown Store Summary - Expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/store/999999/summary


### 28. Final Waste Summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waste/store/1/summary


### 29. Final Inventory Verification
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1
